**Heading
Stress analysis of a thin-walled cylindrical pressure vessel using S8R quadratic shell elements.

*INCLUDE, INPUT=all.msh
*INCLUDE, INPUT=skir_sless_top_LOAD.nam
*INCLUDE, INPUT=base_plate_center_YFIX.nam

*BOUNDARY
base_plate_center_YFIX,1,3
skir_sless_top_LOAD,1,2

*MATERIAL,NAME=STEEL
*ELASTIC
2.09000000e+05, 2.80000000e-01
*DENSITY
7.8E-9


*SHELL SECTION, ELSET=Eall, MATERIAL=STEEL
25


** step 1, linear buckling using preloaded state
*STEP
*STATIC

*DLOAD
skir_sless_top_LOAD,P,50

*NODE FILE, OUTPUT=2D
U
*END STEP



